@host = http://localhost:5283
@token = YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE
@contractId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@contractorId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@pageNumber = 1
@pageSize = 10

### Contract - Get by Id
GET {{host}}/api/v1/Contract/{{contractId}}
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Contract - Get Paging
GET {{host}}/api/v1/Contract/Paging/{{pageNumber}}/{{pageSize}}
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Contract - Create
POST {{host}}/api/v1/Contract
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{}

###

### Contract - Update
PUT {{host}}/api/v1/Contract
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "id": "{{contractId}}"
}

###

### Contract - Delete
DELETE {{host}}/api/v1/Contract/{{contractId}}
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Contract View - Get by ContractorId
GET {{host}}/api/v1/Contract/View/Contractor/{{contractorId}}
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Contract View - Get by ContractorId Paging
GET {{host}}/api/v1/Contract/View/Contractor/{{contractorId}}/Paging/{{pageNumber}}/{{pageSize}}
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###


